      "writtenOn": "2026-02-24T15:01:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The check above is determining the conditions for when we need to polyfill pixel center. I\u0027m not sure why it checks the extra conditions, but i don\u0027t think they\u0027re necessarily relevant for framebuffer fetch?",
      "parentUuid": "add66a88_bc667a05",
      "revId": "92ffead253d09ba8ea5a0adc38ddd5f9e65825d4",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c2998e56_5c2f8a0d",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/vulkan/RenderPipelineVk.cpp",
